    <detaileddescription>
<para>Every nested namespace groups the defaults for one <ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref> section. These constants are baked into the binary, not read from a file; deployment overrides come from the environment via <ref refid="classEnvLoader" kindref="compound">EnvLoader</ref>. Several entries are deliberately insecure development placeholders (database password, token secret, wildcard CORS) and must be overridden in production. <simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classConfigurator" kindref="compound">Configurator</ref>, <ref refid="classEnvLoader" kindref="compound">EnvLoader</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
